  ],
  "exercise_count": 13,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "任何数的加法都满足交换律和结合律.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**交换律：对于任意两数 $a$ 和 $b$，下列等式成立.**$a+b=b+a$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例. $(-6)+(-10)=-(6+10)=-16$；$(-10)+(-6)=-(10+6)=-16$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**结合律：对于任意数 $a,b,c$，下列等式成立.**$(a+b)+c=a+(b+c)$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "应用加法定律可以任意选定运算顺序，使几个加数的加法计算变得简便.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "特别是需要把几个正数和负数相加时，可以把正数与负数分别相加，然后再把正数的和与负数的和相加.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 1. $-4+(-20)+6+13+(-7)+8+(-5)$ $=-36+27=-9$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1) $-4+(-20)+(-7)+(-5)=-36$；2) $6+13+8=27$；3) $-36+27=-9$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 2. $4.72+(-5.7)+(-308.6)+19.1+(-120.12)$ $+3.28=-434.42+27.1=-407.32$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#10"
      ]
    },
